---
import Header from "../components/header.astro"
import Tags from "../components/tags.astro"
import Theme from "../components/theme.astro"
import Topbar from "../components/topbar.astro"

import stylesUrl from "../sass/index.scss?url"
import '@fontsource-variable/inter';
import Footer from "../components/footer.astro";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html >
  <head>
    <Theme />
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no" />
    <link rel="preload" href={stylesUrl} as="style">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href={stylesUrl}>
    <script type="text/javascript" src="../"></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <Topbar />
    <div>
      <Header />
      <div class="container">
        <div class="project">
          <div class="projects__identification margin-bottom-64">
            <p class="projects__header projects__header--scale"> AI-powered Form for Marketplace </p>
            <div class="projects__tags">
              <div><Tags text='Product' outlined={true}/></div>
              <div><Tags text='AI' outlined={true}/></div>
              <div><Tags text='2025' outlined={true}/></div>

            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="project__main">
            <div class="project__nav">
             <div class="project__nav-list">
              <a href="#context" data-section="context">Context</a>
              <a href="#challenge" data-section="challenge">Challenge</a>
              <a href="#my-role" data-section="my-role">My Role</a>
              <a href="#solution" data-section="solution">Solution</a>
              <a href="#outcome" data-section="outcome">Outcome</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="project__content">
              <div class="project__case-study">
                <div class="project__introduction">
                  <span class="project__text"><span class="font-weight-medium">Role:</span> Product Owner </span>
                  <span class="project__text"><span class="font-weight-medium">Timeline:</span> 2025 </span>
                </div>
                <video controls width="600">
                  <source src="/images/video-ai-form.mov" type="video/mp4" />
                </video>
                <div class="project__context">
                  <span class="project__subtitle" id="context"> Context </span>
                  <br>
                  <span class="project__section-content"> As part of Decathlon’s circular economy strategy, a digital marketplace was created to allow users to resell sports equipment and apparel directly to other users. The initiative aimed to extend product lifecycles, reduce waste, and introduce a sustainable value stream within the Decathlon ecosystem. </span>
                </div>

                <div class="project__challenge">
                  <span class="project__subtitle" id="challenge"> Challenge </span>
                  <div class="project__section-content">
                    <span> Create a marketplace experience that allowed users to: </span>
                    <ul>
                      <li class="project__list-item"> Publish second-hand items quickly and easily </li>
                      <li class="project__list-item"> Reduce effort and friction during listing creation </li>
                      <li class="project__list-item"> Ensure clear, accurate product information and pricing</li>
                      <li class="project__list-item"> Encourage adoption through a fast and intuitive flow </li>
                    </ul>
                    <span>
                      The interface needed to minimize decision fatigue while maintaining trust and listing quality.
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="project__role">
                  <span class="project__subtitle" id="my-role"> My Role </span>
                  <div class="project__section-content">
                    <span>As Product Owner, I:</span>
                    <ul> 
                      <li>Defined the end-to-end marketplace experience</li> 
                      <li>Designed flows for listing creation, publication, and management</li> 
                      <li>Built the product logic and supporting business model</li> 
                      <li>Led the development of an AI-assisted listing form</li> 
                      <li>Defined automation logic for item recognition and pricing suggestions</li> 
                      <li>Held regular alignment meetings with the Decathlon team</li> 
                      <li>Collaborated with design, engineering, and business stakeholders</li> 
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="project__solution">
                  <span class="project__subtitle" id="solution"> Solution </span>
                  <div class="project__section-content">
                    <span>
                      The marketplace experience was designed to make listing an item fast, intuitive, and flexible across web and mobile. A key feature was the AI-powered listing form, allowing users to create a listing in under one minute:
                    </span>
                    <ul> 
                      <li>Item recognition via image upload</li> 
                      <li>Automatic title and description generation</li> 
                      <li>Suggested category and package size</li> 
                      <li>AI-assisted price estimation</li> 
                      <li>Option to review, edit, and publish instantly</li> 
                    </ul>
                    <span>
                      This reduced friction, improved listing quality, and simplified the listing process for all users - not just first-time sellers.
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="project__outcome">
                  <span class="project__subtitle" id="outcome"> Outcome </span>
                  <div class="project__section-content">
                    <ul> 
                      <li> Enabled Decathlon to support its circular economy strategy through peer-to-peer resale </li> 
                      <li> Reduced friction in listing creation, encouraging user participation </li> 
                      <li> Improved listing quality and pricing consistency through AI assistance </li> 
                      <li> Delivered a scalable marketplace foundation for sustainable commerce </li> 
                      <li> Encouraged reuse and extended product lifecycle within the Decathlon ecosystem </li> 
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
